1
00:00:00,770 --> 00:00:01,993
Top of her class.

2
00:00:01,883 --> 00:00:03,760
Eleven drafts to say 'hey'.

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,120
Explain that.

4
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:06,624
Easy.

5
00:00:06,514 --> 00:00:08,160
She's not into him.

6
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,600
She's pinned his chat.

7
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:10,656
…Fair point.

8
00:00:10,546 --> 00:00:12,470
But I don't think it's him.

9
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:17,030
Cancelled again?

10
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,327
Rescheduled.

11
00:00:18,217 --> 00:00:19,150
Thursday.

12
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:21,010
He always has a thing.

13
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:22,631
I know, I know.

14
00:00:22,521 --> 00:00:23,334
Thursday.

15
00:00:23,224 --> 00:00:26,300
I'll be so on time it'll be insulting.

16
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,190
He's on time for the voice note.

17
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:31,619
Don't look at me.

18
00:00:31,509 --> 00:00:33,970
I'm a hallucination brought on by revision.

19
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:36,230
Hallucinations don't bring tea.

20
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,713
Straight cuts are for people who've given up.

21
00:00:39,603 --> 00:00:40,230
You said.

22
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:44,870
You go quiet right before you get brilliant.

23
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,452
Everyone likes you.

24
00:00:46,342 --> 00:00:48,270
It's weird you picked me.

25
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:49,440
I didn't pick you.

26
00:00:49,330 --> 00:00:52,350
You were the only one in the library making that face.

27
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:56,290
He's really there, when he's there.

28
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:57,630
And when he isn't?

29
00:00:57,770 --> 00:00:59,120
…Refreshing a screen.

30
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:07,930
That's nine times.

31
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:08,670
Eight.

32
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:09,690
…Nine.

33
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:12,280
She flips it over like a lottery ticket.

34
00:01:12,370 --> 00:01:13,900
Not for the pizza app.

35
00:01:13,990 --> 00:01:19,131
There's a study where women who weren't sure a guy liked them were the most into him.

36
00:01:19,021 --> 00:01:20,552
Small, college students.

37
00:01:20,442 --> 00:01:21,440
Don't quote me.

38
00:01:21,530 --> 00:01:23,600
So she's hooked on not knowing.

39
00:01:23,790 --> 00:01:24,600
…Maybe.

40
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,810
I'm quoting you.

41
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:31,090
What has he actually done?

42
00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:33,030
He's figuring himself out.

43
00:01:33,620 --> 00:01:35,753
Potential never disappoints.

44
00:01:35,643 --> 00:01:36,982
It never cancels.

45
00:01:36,872 --> 00:01:40,450
It lives in a future where you wrote the ending.

46
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:42,690
She's put months in.

47
00:01:42,730 --> 00:01:43,940
Sunk cost.

48
00:01:43,980 --> 00:01:45,590
Sunk cost with feelings.

49
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,797
Hoping isn't dumb.

50
00:01:46,687 --> 00:01:50,490
Apparently couples do better when they see the best in each other.

51
00:01:50,580 --> 00:01:51,700
And when they don't?

52
00:01:51,790 --> 00:01:55,040
…Then you're drawing a nice picture of someone who isn't there.

53
00:01:55,830 --> 00:01:57,556
I don't think she wants him.

54
00:01:57,446 --> 00:01:59,750
I think she wants to be picked by him.

55
00:01:59,790 --> 00:02:00,740
Same thing.

56
00:02:00,830 --> 00:02:02,360
It really isn't.

57
00:02:04,550 --> 00:02:06,274
He sat with me till two a.m.

58
00:02:06,164 --> 00:02:07,600
before my presentation.

59
00:02:07,690 --> 00:02:08,506
I know.

60
00:02:08,396 --> 00:02:09,715
You told me.

61
00:02:09,605 --> 00:02:10,320
Twice.

62
00:02:10,410 --> 00:02:12,300
He never asked how it went.

63
00:02:13,490 --> 00:02:16,460
In all of these, he's asking me how it went.

64
00:02:17,350 --> 00:02:19,595
I keep drawing a guy who asks.

65
00:02:19,735 --> 00:02:20,485
Yeah.

66
00:02:21,075 --> 00:02:24,635
I wrote eleven drafts to someone who doesn't exist.

67
00:02:24,725 --> 00:02:25,515
Finally.

68
00:02:25,605 --> 00:02:26,505
Don't.

69
00:02:26,695 --> 00:02:27,405
…Finally.

70
00:02:32,095 --> 00:02:33,258
That's the girl.

71
00:02:33,148 --> 00:02:34,245
She looks okay.

72
00:02:34,335 --> 00:02:36,165
She hasn't checked her phone once.

73
00:02:36,255 --> 00:02:37,385
Is that a sign?

74
00:02:37,425 --> 00:02:38,455
…Of something.

75
00:02:39,245 --> 00:02:40,075
Who is it?

76
00:02:40,165 --> 00:02:41,115
Nobody.

77
00:02:41,205 --> 00:02:42,455
How many drafts?

78
00:02:42,645 --> 00:02:43,455
…Four.

79
00:02:43,695 --> 00:02:44,475
Krish.

80
00:02:45,765 --> 00:02:48,029
You're not waiting for their reply.

81
00:02:47,919 --> 00:02:49,875
You're waiting to feel chosen.
